part asks_d11
  tally 2
  note "D-11 · Prices rising 8 %, as of 2031-12-31, as known 2026-09-30: each figure in the reality (3 % throughout) and as if in scenario infl8; the bond under cpi103 (103 where unpublished) and infl8. What follows the index is what reads it."
  note "The register's seed 20261001 is no value: a seed is an ask's literal (L §7.4), stated on D-10's path asks; no expression prints it."
  note "Does not follow the index: the life table by inputs-of q_die, and the fund's returns by inputs-of r_path replayed on one path (L §5.16), their rows read with no lv_infl row among them. Only the tax scale and its reducing amount, inputs (pit3_rate, pit3_reducing) read as their rows stand, rest on their absence from readers-of lv_infl: readers-of lists only readers."

